cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "curvature-kovacic: constructive integration of scalar ODEs via Kovacic's algorithm"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-29
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: "Pan-Collantes"
    given-names: "Antonio J."
  - family-names: "Alvarez-Garcia"
    given-names: "J. A."
abstract: >-
  Companion code for the manuscript "From curvature to Kovacic: a geometric
  approach to integrability of scalar ODEs".  It implements the three
  constructive integration algorithms of the paper and a self-contained
  SymPy version of Kovacic's algorithm.
keywords:
  - differential equations
  - Kovacic algorithm
  - Riccati equation
  - symbolic computation
  - integrability
